        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Schiff, Daniel Dae Kim, David Shore\n- Companies: Daniel Dae Kim's production company\n- TV Series: House, Three Stories, The Good Doctor, the 2013 American series\n- Awards: Emmy Award for Outstanding Writing for a Drama Series\n\nFacts:\n- In 2005, David Shore won the Emmy Award for Outstanding Writing for a Drama Series for the House episode \"Three Stories.\"\n- David Shore wrote a new television series based on a 2013 American series.\n- Richard Schiff appears in that new television series.\n- Daniel Dae Kim's production company produces that new television series.",
