        "original_id": "ebb10bc3-7cac-5b15-9603-2644138225fb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Schiff, David Shore, Daniel Dae Kim\n- TV Series: The Good Doctor, Three Stories\n- Companies: ABC, 3AD\n- Roles: Dr. Glassman\n- Places: San José, California\n- Awards: Emmy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- In 2005, David Shore won an Emmy for Outstanding Writing for a Drama Series for the television episode \"Three Stories.\"\n- The Good Doctor is an American medical-drama television series developed by David Shore and based on a 2013 South Korean series of the same name.\n- Daniel Dae Kim runs the film and television production company 3AD, which is producing the television series The Good Doctor.\n- In September 2017, Richard Schiff was set to begin appearing in a leading role in ABC's prime time drama series The Good Doctor.\n- In The Good Doctor, Richard Schiff plays Dr. Glassman, the president of a fictional teaching hospital in San José, California.",
